      "note": "B4b: the ranking-side projection moved from src/inference/ranking.cpp to the rule's one home src/inference/strong_beat.h. The allowlist is the complete set of deliberate edits: the literal 480 became the named constant kStrongBeatTicks (same value), static_cast<size_t> is a spelling, and the inlined distance-1 tail became the shared is_minor_2nd_rub call (that helper is itself pinned byte-identical to the old constraints.cpp local by the is_minor_2nd_rub entry below).",
